{
  "name": "automated-codejson-generator",
  "version": "1.2.1",
  "description": "Github Action that allows for automated code.json creation and maintenance ",
  "longDescription": "This GitHub Action automates the creation and ongoing maintenance of code.json files, which are essential for adhering to the Federal Source Code Policy in federal open source projects. It efficiently calculates complex metadata, including programming languages, repository details, and labor hours, ensuring that all required compliance data is accurate and current. The action provides flexibility by allowing users to either push changes directly or create pull requests, depending on repository branch protection settings. Furthermore, it incorporates automated validation checks on pull requests, preventing non-compliant code. This system significantly reduces manual effort and minimizes the risk of metadata errors, streamlining the compliance process for federal developers.",
